    <div class="cta-block">
      <h3>Your Eternal Destiny Is<br><em>Decided Right Now.</em><br>What Will You Do With the Truth?</h3>
      <p>
        You have read the warning. You know about April 15, 1904.
        You know what the 501(c)(3) state church is.
